            <ArticleTitle>Problems getting back in the swing after breast cancer: gaps in rehabilitative care.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1423-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>For more than 50 years, Cancer has explored every facet of malignant disease, including morphology, therapy, epidemiology, biology, historical perspective, and basic science. However, the Editors of Cancer believe that the human beings who bear the burden of this illness have much to teach us, and we now solicit essays from patients and family members about their experience.</AbstractText>
